al language follows the Quiet Canvas design system in DESIGN.md."],"decisions":[],"entryConditions":["A holder of members.manage pressed Add member (or Edit access, or the key count of a row) on the Members page, on a desktop layout.","The base state is Add member for a person: nickname filled in, kind Human, and the keys of the Reviewer preset checked.","The render context selects one Workspace viewport preset, one Locale and one theme; the drawer is a column on the right of a dimmed ground."],"intent":"Show the Add member and Edit access drawer of the Members page as built from Adapter Widgets only: the nickname and kind of a member, and the permission key checklist grouped by domain, with the label the keys would get.","interactionRules":["The drawer asks for a nickname and, when adding, the kind; a kind is fixed once the member exists, so editing shows it as text.","Keys are checked in a list grouped by domain, each with its identifier and description; Start from preset replaces the checked keys with a preset's and the resulting Access label updates as keys change.","Keys for people only are marked and cannot be checked for an Agent; checking a key also checks the keys it requires, and a stored key set that lacks one is flagged.","Granting members.manage warns that the holder can grant every key; keys this UIUX version does not know are listed apart, kept and grant nothing.","A refused save (a taken nickname, removing the last manager) shows its reason above the buttons and keeps the draft; Save is disabled without a nickname and busy while saving."],"references":[{"label":"Phase 5 of the closed loop: dogfood coverage of the core surfaces","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/379#discussioncomment-19257377"},{"relation":"opened-from","type":"view","viewId":"c7d3b101-5a1e-4b6c-8f2d-3e9a0b7c4d01"}],"requirements":["01a11c09-ba80-7bef-96fe-4a4bae3ab528","01a11c09-baec-71e2-b578-6efd9ee7ec98"]},"variants":{"add-